<title>USA: Brightpoint over allotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint over allotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Friday that several underwriters of its 2.2 million share offering exercised their over-allotment option to buy an additional 500,000 shares of common stock at $30.00 per share.     The</p>
<p>offer expired August 12, 1997.</p>
<p>Brightpoint provides distribution and value-added logistics services to the wireless communications industry.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
